  "rootInitUninitializedTitle": "Not initialized: this server does not have a Root credential yet",
  "@rootInitUninitializedTitle": {"description": "伺服器明確回報「還沒有 Root」時的狀態結論。只有在這個階段才列出初始化步驟。"},
  "rootInitInitializedTitle": "Initialization complete",
  "@rootInitInitializedTitle": {"description": "伺服器回報已有 Root 憑據時的狀態結論。"},
  "rootInitInitializedNote": "The server's config file already holds a Root credential, so the one-time initialization door is closed: running init-root again is always refused, and that is the design rather than a fault. The Root login endpoint is live on the server, and the sign-in entry now sits in the \"Login and session\" card below; this card stays read-only and collects no credentials.",
  "@rootInitInitializedNote": {"description": "已初始化時如實說明：初始化門已關、Root 登入端點在伺服器上可用、登入入口在下方會話卡；本卡仍然唯讀。"},
  "rootInitUnreachableTitle": "Cannot reach the server, so the initialization status is unknown",
  "@rootInitUnreachableTitle": {"description": "連不上伺服器（含逾時）時的狀態結論：不能把它講成「尚未初始化」。"},
  "rootInitForbiddenTitle": "The server refuses to report the initialization status",
  "@rootInitForbiddenTitle": {"description": "伺服器有回應但拒絕把狀態交給這個呼叫端時的狀態結論。"},
  "rootInitUnknownTitle": "This check did not produce a reliable answer",
  "@rootInitUnknownTitle": {"description": "伺服器答了但結果不可信（內容抵觸合同或其他錯誤）時的狀態結論。"},
  "rootInitUnknownHint": "Ask the server again. This check is read-only: repeating it cannot create, change or overwrite a Root credential.",
  "@rootInitUnknownHint": {"description": "結果不明確時的處置：再問一次，並保證重複查詢不會動到任何 Root 憑據。"},
  "rootInitConfigMissingHint": "That data directory does not have a config file yet — which is a different situation from “config file exists but has no Root”.",
  "@rootInitConfigMissingHint": {"description": "config_exists 為偽時補的一句：與「有檔案但還沒填 Root」分開講。"},
  "rootInitEnvOverrideHint": "Note: the environment variable ER_SECURITY_ROOT_PASSWORD_HASH is set and overrides the config file at run time. init-root refuses to write in that state, so remove the variable or treat that credential as the real Root source.",
  "@rootInitEnvOverrideHint": {"description": "env_override 為真時的警告：檔案裡沒有不等於這個服務沒有 Root，且此時 init-root 必然拒絕寫入。"},
  "rootInitStepStop": "Stop the running service on the machine where the server lives. Initialization has to happen after the service releases the database lock; running init-root while it is up is always refused.",
  "@rootInitStepStop": {"description": "步驟一：停服務（單寫入實例鎖的真實約束）。"},
  "rootInitStepMigrate": "For a brand-new data directory, run `evernight-server migrate --data-dir <data-dir>` first to create the schema — init-root also refuses when the audit table is missing.",
  "@rootInitStepMigrate": {"description": "步驟二：全新資料目錄先建結構；命令列文字不翻譯，四份逐字相同。"},
  "rootInitStepInitialize": "Run `evernight-server init-root --data-dir <data-dir> --password-stdin` and give the password and its confirmation on standard input, one line each.",
  "@rootInitStepInitialize": {"description": "步驟三：本機一次性初始化命令；口令只經標準輸入，命令列上不出現口令值。"},
  "rootInitStepRestart": "Start the service again.",
  "@rootInitStepRestart": {"description": "步驟四：重新啟動服務（生效的憑據由啟動時讀取）。"},
  "rootInitStepRecheck": "Return to this screen and check once more; the status follows the config file.",
  "@rootInitStepRecheck": {"description": "步驟五：回本頁重新檢查。"},
  "rootInitSecretBoundary": "This screen has no password field and sends no credential anywhere: initializing Root is possible only through a command run on the server itself.",
  "@rootInitSecretBoundary": {"description": "界線那一句：本步不收集口令、不開 HTTP 初始化通路。"},
