  "registrationReviewEmptyNotice": "No application matches this filter. Switching the sign-up mode does not remove applications that were already filed - they stay here until somebody decides about them.",
  "@registrationReviewEmptyNotice": {"description": "空名冊那句說明：如實講「切模式不動歷史」，不拿空頁冒充沒人申請過。"},
  "registrationReviewUnavailableNotice": "The application list could not be read.",
  "@registrationReviewUnavailableNotice": {"description": "讀取名冊失敗的兜底句（機器碼未收錄時使用；其餘處置仍按碼分流的那一句）。"},
  "registrationReviewSubmittedLabel": "Submitted at",
