  "@inviteCodeIssueConfirmTitle": {"description": "簽發確認框標題。"},
  "inviteCodeIssueConfirmBody": "You are about to issue an invite code labeled “{label}”, redeemable {maxUses} time(s), {expires}. It only admits a standard account — no role, no activity, no session. The full code is shown once after issuing and is not stored in readable form: if it's lost, issue a new one. Nothing can redeem a code yet, because invite-based self-registration is not open in this version.",
  "@inviteCodeIssueConfirmBody": {"description": "簽發確認框：講完憑證邊界、一次性展示、丟失重簽、以及「本版本還不能核銷」。{expires} 由界面填「永不過期」或到期時刻句。", "placeholders": {"label": {"type": "String"}, "maxUses": {"type": "String"}, "expires": {"type": "String"}}},
